OL,3,GNEWSAWhy some of city's public clocks
OL,4,Aare out of time
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral of Hull's best-known public
OL,7,Fclocks are either stopped or showing
OL,8,Fthe wrong time, including the clock at
OL,9,Fthe recently reopened Maritime Museum.
OL,11,FThe Grade II* listed museum reopened on
OL,12,F8 August following a #20m renovation,
OL,13,Fbut its clock remains set at 02:13.
OL,15,FElsewhere in the city centre, clocks at
OL,16,FHull Minster, Paragon Station and
OL,17,FGuildhall have either stopped or
OL,18,Fdrifted out of sync.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
