OL,3,GNEWSAWhy some of city's public clocks
OL,4,Aare out of time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hull City Council spokesperson said
OL,7,Fthe historic clock mechanisms at the
OL,8,FMaritime Museum and Guildhall were
OL,9,Fmaintained by a specialist contractor
OL,10,Fand that the authority had made contact
OL,11,Fabout the current issues.
